# Platform note.  Upstream builds on Windows only under mingw or cygwin
# (tailor.h lines 99-113), and the registry's Windows toolchains are
# MSVC-based, which gnulib's mingw branches do not compile under.  The one
# source gnulib compiles only there, stat-w32.c (the mingw arm of
# GL_COND_OBJ_FSTAT / GL_COND_OBJ_STAT), is therefore not carried, and the
# presubmit matrix leaves Windows out for the same reason.
